m&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOxxczMYbttP8HJRR1x5-C5f_dOq3cN9SfjQfhs8qrAqw&oe=6AC5157E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot7_2560x1440.png", "id": "558269733718610", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974562_558269737051943_6901004042255900869_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rFQbxxc0jIoQ7kNvwHEyYs8&_nc_oc=AdprHZQf-CsU4qJww8iws1EjowEoi2eGVW8z2DtRdMNOiulpsh9GrYo44mOsvURYuCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNTY_TLnzK9imMgUsPtAoiL0iAxTNH0o6zYjgCUD0HVSQ&oe=6AC512CF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bold Type VR", "keywords": ["BoldTypeVR", "Word", "Puzzle", "PuzzleVR", "WordPuzzle"], "long_description": "Choose Your Challenge: Tackle puzzles at your own pace with Easy, Medium, and Hard modes.\nCustomizable Themes: Personalize your game with vibrant letter color themes for a visually engaging experience.\nHints to the Rescue: Stuck on a word? The Hint Menu is your secret weapon, showing all the words you need to uncover.\nAchievements & Trophies: Unlock unique trophies as you meet specific achievements and showcase your word-finding mastery!\n\nWhether you\u2019re a casual player looking for relaxing fun or a puzzle enthusiast seeking a challenge, The Bold Type offers endless entertainment and a fresh twist on the classic word search game and an unforgettable experience that challenges your mind while keeping you engaged in a stunning virtual world.\n\nStep into the world of the Bold Type, a cutting-edge VR adventure that redefines the classic word search puzzle! ", "short_description": "Dive into a thrilling puzzle world \nwhere words are hidden all around you\u2014can you find them all?\n\nImmerse yourself in a fully interactive 360\u00b0 puzzle challenge where every turn and corner bring new discoveries. It\u2019s not just a word search\u2014it\u2019s an exploration! With the power of VR, you\u2019re not just solving puzzles\u2014you\u2019re living them!"}]}, "deve